#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/request/request.rst:103
msgid ""
"Checks whether a certain variable was sent via a ``POST`` request. To make "
"sure that a request was sent using ``POST`` you should call this function on "
"at least one variable. This is a short hand for ``$request-"
">variable('variable', \\phpbb\\request\\request_interface::POST);``."
msgstr ""
"Checks whether a certain variable was sent via a ``POST`` request. To make "
"sure that a request was sent using ``POST`` you should call this function on "
"at least one variable. This is a short hand for ``$request-"
">variable('variable', \\phpbb\\request\\request_interface::POST);``."

